{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b704f29b44623295a5db5166d6d48126f7a14742.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = - 2$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, the largest number in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/60833c63f3679d85eaeadff88984a102df702ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ - 3a, 4a, \\frac {24}{a}, a^2, 1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"149\" height=\"37\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e9e846c4fdd5efe307aad511c2701a1587f4a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -3a \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 4a \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac {24}{a} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ a^2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"392\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844261808b8af79e74512c968631470ddc288a58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3833dfddcd1ae30631b61b9dec19123e5611f143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ - 3a, 4a, \\frac {24}{a}, a^2, 1\\} = \\{ (-3)(-2), 4(-2), \\frac{24}{-2}, (-2)^2, 1 \\}= \\{ 6, -8, -12, 4, 1 \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"587\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>The largest element of this set is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b448f79085be5111b2912e1dd1d8fbdfdb979ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} -3a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"83\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is negative, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f043d62e95f89a5f5373c64aeca1e94a99d05319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3a$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/9698c992334be77221be8c8c819909eca34fde9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4666d5b88a5a12f9055189db2a68e4135c67f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/6706cf43f2f01e7ce8682b88ef7aa3f94448dda9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> are negative.  Evaluating the positive expressions shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/9/3d926c7013b77ef5960996436d271672ca3b8b08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} -3a} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"117\" height=\"30\" /> is the largest.\n</p><p>~sanaops9\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_rGBskmj29M\">https://youtu.be/_rGBskmj29M</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2>